reatment, or laser hair removal, our expert team will ensure you leave our salon looking and feeling your best self. Our premium, organic BECOME range is formulated upon a natural, plant-based foundation of algae and seaweed extracts, power-packed with vitamins, antioxidants, and minerals for radiant health and beauty without harm to you or the planet.\r\n\r\nOur salon welcomes everyone, and you don’t have to be a guest at Hippocrates to book! Try something new today and call us for your ultimate, nature-fuelled beauty experience.\r\n\r\n<section><picture><source srcset=\"/media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=545&amp;rnd=133233452311870000, /media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=818&amp;rnd=133233452311870000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1500px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=510&amp;rnd=133233452311870000, /media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=765&amp;rnd=133233452311870000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 1200px) and (max-width: 1499px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=330&amp;rnd=133233452311870000, /media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=495&amp;rnd=133233452311870000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1199px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=290&amp;rnd=133233452311870000, /media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=435&amp;rnd=133233452311870000 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)\" /><source srcset=\"/media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;mode=crop&amp;heightratio=1&amp;width=350&amp;rnd=133233452311870000, /media/1veivl2d/brian-square.jpg?anchor=center&amp;